From 491b3e036995e8f7e9244bf52ac776a28a50b4b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shezitt <purpleplanetgroup@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:23:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Step 4A: separate diagnostic app org.questxarm.reader with
 QuestXarmPoseV1 LOCAL-space telemetry

- applicationId org.questxarm.reader, label 'Quest xArm Input Diagnostic'
- grip + head poses located in LOCAL at one query time with raw XrSpaceLocationFlags
- action activity, session state/focus, LOCAL reference-space-change events
- legacy head-relative wE9ryARX output disabled (unchanged if re-enabled)
- rendering and frame loop unchanged; no robot control
